rathole (0.5.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the time 0.3.36 Cargo.lock as a patch and build with --locked.
    The build ran cargo update, which added powerfmt at whatever version
    crates.io offered that day, so a rebuild after powerfmt 0.2.1
    (2026-10-05) no longer reproduced the binary.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 08:51:44 +0200

rathole (0.5.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build reproducibly: identical bytes across build path, hostname, locale,
    timezone, umask, CPU count and file ordering.
  * Record the Rust toolchain among the build dependencies, so the build
    can be reproduced from its .buildinfo.
  * Publish this version's source package and build record at
    buildinfos.pkg.haus, so anyone can reproduce the build and check it.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Wed, 02 Sep 2026 11:38:12 +0200

